# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your actual values.

```env
# GitHub Copilot
GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-github-personal-access-token

# Trilium Next (MCP)
TRILIUM_API_URL=https://your-trilium-server.com/etapi
TRILIUM_API_TOKEN=your-trilium-api-token

# Tavily Search
TAVILY_API_KEY=your-tavily-api-key

# Filesystem Connectors (example values)
FS_MSI_HOST=10.0.0.220
FS_MSI_USER=jrs
FS_MSI_ALLOWED_DIRS=/home/jrs/
FS_MSI_PROFILE_STORAGE_PATH=/home/jrs/.specstory/history
FS_MSI_WORKSPACE_STORAGE_ROOT=/home/jrs/.config/Code/User/workspaceStorage

FS_DNS_HOST=10.0.0.152
FS_DNS_USER=root
FS_DNS_ALLOWED_DIRS=/root/
FS_DNS_PROFILE_STORAGE_PATH=/root/.specstory/history
FS_DNS_WORKSPACE_STORAGE_ROOT=/root/.config/Code/User/workspaceStorage

FS_PROXMOX_HOST=10.0.0.250
FS_PROXMOX_USER=root
FS_PROXMOX_ALLOWED_DIRS=/root/
FS_PROXMOX_PROFILE_STORAGE_PATH=/root/.specstory/history
FS_PROXMOX_WORKSPACE_STORAGE_ROOT=/root/.config/Code/User/workspaceStorage
```

**Important**: Never commit the `.env` file to version control!
